---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="首頁" lang="zh" description="澳門高爾夫球會 — 澳門中心的冠軍級高爾夫體驗">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
    <div class="hero-content">
      <h1>澳門高爾夫球會</h1>
      <p class="hero-tagline">在澳門中心，享受冠軍級高爾夫體驗</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>歡迎來到澳門高爾夫球會</h2>
      <p>坐落於澳門迷人景觀之中，我們提供世界級高爾夫球場、卓越設施和溫暖的社區。無論您是經驗豐富的球手還是高爾夫新手，澳門高爾夫球會都歡迎您。</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="background: var(--color-white);">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="quick-links">
        <a href="/zh/courses/" class="card quick-link">
          <h3>我們的球場</h3>
          <p>探索澳門最優美的球道，適合各級別的球手。</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/competitions/" class="card quick-link">
          <h3>比賽</h3>
          <p>查看即將舉行的賽事和活動，測試您的球技。</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/membership/" class="card quick-link">
          <h3>會籍</h3>
          <p>加入我們的社區，全年享受獨家禮遇。</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section competition-banner">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>即將舉行：2026澳門公開賽</h2>
      <p>現已接受報名。把握機會參加澳門頂級高爾夫賽事。</p>
      <button class="btn btn-cta" id="heroApplyBtn">立即查詢</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>最新消息</h2>
      <div class="news-grid">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>球場翻新完成</h3>
          <p>我們的後九洞已增設新沙坑和果嶺。歡迎來打一場球，感受變化。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>青少年計劃啟動</h3>
          <p>推出全新青少年發展計劃——培養澳門下一代高爾夫球手。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .hero {
    position: relative;
    height: 70vh;
    min-height: 400px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-dark) 0%, var(--color-primary) 100%);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .hero-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: url('data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 1200 600"><rect fill="%234a7c59" width="1200" height="600"/><ellipse cx="600" cy="300" rx="500" ry="200" fill="%236aa84f"/><ellipse cx="300" cy="500" rx="300" ry="120" fill="%233d6b3a"/></svg>') center/cover;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }
  .hero-content {
    position: relative;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--color-white);
    padding: 2rem;
  }
  .hero-content h1 {
    font-size: 3rem;
    color: var(--color-white);
    font-weight: 200;
  }
  .hero-tagline {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    font-style: italic;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .quick-links {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  .quick-link {
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform 0.2s;
  }
  .quick-link:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .competition-banner {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-dark), var(--color-primary));
    color: var(--color-white);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .competition-banner h2 { color: var(--color-white); }
  .competition-banner p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8); }

  .news-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero-content h1 { font-size: 2rem; }
    .quick-links { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .news-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>

<script>
  document.getElementById('heroApplyBtn')?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    document.getElementById('competition-modal')?.classList.add('open');
  });
</script>
